199
01:12:42,538 --> 01:13:06,735
And that all those at this moment who are happy and content with their lives, enjoying the warmth of friendships, delighting in art and nature, hobbies and so on, who find their work meaningful, who enjoy the fruitfulness of their spiritual practice, and who rejoice in the success of others.

200
01:13:09,019 --> 01:13:10,841
May you be joyful.

201
01:13:14,770 --> 01:13:17,195
May your joyfulness increase.

202
01:13:23,131 --> 01:13:26,399
May you experience the bliss of Nirvana.

203
01:13:53,077 --> 01:14:18,612
radiating our goodwill joy to all beings in all directions may all beings be joyful may your joyfulness increase may you experience the bliss of nirvana

204
01:14:45,828 --> 01:14:49,753
So, as usual, just let these words flow through us.

205
01:14:51,136 --> 01:14:58,827
If you are wise and want to reach the state of peace, you need to behave like this.

206
01:14:59,386 --> 01:15:07,219
You need to be upright, responsible, gentle and humble, easily contented, need only a few things.

207
01:15:08,060 --> 01:15:13,287
Don't always be busy and have the right sort of work.

208
01:15:13,306 --> 01:15:15,210
You need to guard your senses.

209
01:15:15,528 --> 01:15:21,873
and to be modest, not to be exclusively attached to only a few people.

210
01:15:23,515 --> 01:15:28,220
You should not do the slightest thing that a wise person could blame you for.

211
01:15:30,742 --> 01:15:42,412
Always thinking, may all beings be happy, whatever living beings there are, be they weak or strong, big or small, large or slender, living nearby or far away.

212
01:15:42,847 --> 01:15:46,270
Those who have already been born and those who have yet to be born.

213
01:15:46,411 --> 01:15:49,613
May all beings without exception be happy.

214
01:15:53,396 --> 01:15:54,979
Be truthful to one another.

215
01:15:55,019 --> 01:15:58,582
And do not think anyone anywhere is of no value.

216
01:15:59,823 --> 01:16:01,323
Do not wish harm to anyone.

217
01:16:01,664 --> 01:16:03,185
Not even when you're angry.

218
01:16:03,947 --> 01:16:08,770
Just as a mother would protect her only child at the risk of her own life.

219
01:16:08,791 --> 01:16:12,213
So you should let the warmth of your heart go out to all beings.

220
01:16:13,207 --> 01:16:24,198
Let your thoughts go through the whole world, above and below, without any barrier, with no ill will or hatred, whether you are standing, walking, sitting or lying down.

221
01:16:25,279 --> 01:16:29,222
Long as you are awake, develop this affectionate mindfulness.

222
01:16:30,144 --> 01:16:32,806
This, they say, is the noblest way to live.

223
01:16:32,827 --> 01:16:42,657
And if you do not fall into unskillful ways, but live well and develop insight and are no longer attached to all the desires of the senses,

224
01:16:43,057 --> 01:16:48,646
then truly you'll never need to be reborn into this world again.

225
01:16:50,389 --> 01:16:56,878
So please join me in the chanting or if you wish to offer your blessings in the traditional way.

226
01:16:57,060 --> 01:16:59,162
May you be safe, well and happy.

227
01:16:59,863 --> 01:17:03,208
May you live contented in harmony with the world.

228
01:17:05,672 --> 01:17:08,997
Karani Angatakusalena

229
01:17:09,298 --> 01:17:37,128
yantang santang padang gabisame ca sako juca sujuca suvaco ca samuduanati mani santu sako ca subharo ca apake ca ca salauka uti santendryo ca nipago ca

230
01:17:37,479 --> 01:17:41,626
Apakaboko eisuananukido.

231
01:17:42,768 --> 01:17:46,252
Nachakudansamacharekenchi.

232
01:17:46,753 --> 01:17:50,458
Yenawinyupareupawadeyum.

233
01:17:51,261 --> 01:17:54,565
Sukhinowakeminohontu.

234
01:17:55,086 --> 01:17:58,931
Sabesatabawantusukitatam.

235
01:17:59,957 --> 01:18:08,050
Yegejipanabhutati tasavadavarava anavasasam.

236
01:18:09,011 --> 01:18:16,823
Digavaye mahantavamajimarasakanukatulam.

237
01:18:16,844 --> 01:18:24,074
Ditavaye vaadithaye jadurevasantihavidurem.

238
01:18:24,864 --> 01:18:33,899
Bhūtā vāsaṁ vāwezi vāsābe sātā bhāvantu sukhi tātā.

239
01:18:33,920 --> 01:18:41,032
Nāparo parāṁ nīkubetā, nāti mānyatā kathā cīnankēncī.

240
01:18:41,773 --> 01:18:49,185
Vīyārosaṁ nāpatīgāsāṁ yā, nānyamānyāsā duḥkandīcēyā.

241
01:18:50,177 --> 01:18:53,261
Mata yad dhaniyam putam.

242
01:18:53,483 --> 01:18:57,387
Gayu sae kaputam anurake.

243
01:18:58,408 --> 01:19:02,014
He vampi sabha bhutesu.

244
01:19:02,033 --> 01:19:07,060
Mana sambhava ye apari manam.

245
01:19:07,081 --> 01:19:10,405
Meten ca sabha lokasmi.

246
01:19:11,207 --> 01:19:14,811
Mana sambhava ye apari manam.

247
01:19:15,712 --> 01:19:18,497
Udanga do ca teriyam ca.

248
01:19:18,881 --> 01:19:22,826
Asampadanga verangasampadam.

249
01:19:23,606 --> 01:19:26,510
Titancharanasinova.

250
01:19:27,050 --> 01:19:31,835
Sayanova yavatasa vigatamito.

251
01:19:32,775 --> 01:19:35,880
Etasatingaditeya.

252
01:19:35,899 --> 01:19:39,944
Barakmangetangviharangitamam.

253
01:19:40,965 --> 01:19:45,529
Ditincha anupagamarsilova.

254
01:19:45,548 --> 01:19:48,011
Dasanenasampano.

255
01:19:48,582 --> 01:20:02,877
May all beings be happy.

256
01:20:03,296 --> 01:20:26,654
Sābe satta-sukhita hantu, Sābe satta-sukhita hantu, Sābe satta-sukhita hantu, Sādu, sādu, sādu.

257
01:20:28,912 --> 01:20:48,052
very good so i don't forget from now to fall asleep is also part of our practice i'm sure you've heard this before don't forget to put something lovely into the heart and drift away to sweet oblivion and upon awakening make the best of the day can i wish you all a very peaceful night

